    "tags": ["effect", "financial"],
    "notes": "support.microsoft.com EFFECT(0.0525, 4) prints 0.0535426673707582. Golden is the OpenFormula 6.12.19 identity (1+nominal/npery)^npery-1 in IEEE.",
